hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27861","Abdillah ibn Yazid narrated to us, he said: Sa'id, meaning Ibn Abi Ayyub, narrated to us, he said: Abu al-Aswad narrated to me, from al-Nu'man ibn Abi Ayyash al-Zuraqi, from Khawlah bint Thamir al-Ansariyyah, that she heard the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, say: The world is green and sweet, and men plunge into the wealth of Allah, the Mighty and Majestic, without right. For them is the Fire on the Day of Resurrection."
